    {
      "text": "\n####In particular, operations on key/value pairs can cause:\n- Out-of-memory errors in the driver\n- Out-of-memory errors on the executor nodes\n- Shuffle failures\n- “Straggler tasks” or partitions, which are especially slow to compute",
